[INFO] Step 1. Expert Recruitment
Agent 1 (🧑🏽‍⚕️ Plastic Surgeon): Specializes in reconstructive and aesthetic surgery, particularly in procedures like rhinoplasty.
Agent 2 (👨🏻‍⚕️ Otolaryngologist (ENT Specialist)): Focuses on disorders related to the ear, nose, and throat, and can provide insight on nasal airflow and potential complications post-surgery.
Agent 3 (👨🏽‍⚕️ Respiratory Therapist): Specializes in the assessment and treatment of respiratory disorders, providing expertise on airflow dynamics and respiratory sounds.

